 "transcript": [
  "[action] (to Chen Fu) goes to see father",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"We have been working day and night to earn money and you would not give a thought to your children and you would not give a thought to your old age, and you would not even give a thought to the day when you would die.\"",
  "[action] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu answers his eldest son with irritation.",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"Well, and I did not think of it because I had my children, and I did not care about my old age, and I did not care about my death, and I did not care about my children, and I did not care about my old age, and I did not care about my death, and I did not care about my children.\"",
  "[action] Chen Fu is puzzled by his son's behavior.",
  "[says] (to the eldest son) Chen Fu answers his son's frustration with indifference.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"Now why should I care?\"",
  "[action] The eldest son leaves the house and walks away.",
  "[action] (to the second son) Chen Fu calls his second son to talk.",
  "Chen Fu (to the second son): \"I have had enough of this in my house,\"",
  "Chen Fu (to the second son): \"I have a son who hates me and a son who loves me and I do not know why.\"",
  "[says] Chen Fu speaks to the second son, expressing his annoyance.",
  "Chen Fu (to the eldest son): \"Well, and what now with my son?\"",
  "[action] Chen Fu walks slowly among his lands.",
  "[action] The eldest son walks with his father.",
  "[action] Chen Fu and his son walk through the fields.",
  "[action] The eldest son walks silently with his father.",
  "[action] The second son follows the group.",
  "the eldest son (to Chen Fu): \"Well, and what now with my son?\"",
